<th id="S5.T3.7.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Avg. SE</th>
<th id="S5.T3.7.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Reconf. Times</th>
<th id="S5.T3.7.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">PQoS vio.</th>
